      "cooked": "<p>So I was playing Oblivaeon and at one point in phase 3,&nbsp;I noticed that Oblivaeon started playing Aeon men from the Oblivaeon deck. &nbsp;Checking his deck showed that a few Aeon men were in his deck. &nbsp;Not exactly sure how they got there, but I do know Sky Deck was in play earlier and Aeon Men were getting destroyed. &nbsp;They’re supposed to go to the bottom of the Aeon Men deck, though, right?</p>\n<p>Is this a known issue? &nbsp;Or is there another way Aeon Men could appear in Oblivaeon’s deck?</p>\n<p>Sorry, iOS, so no logs.</p>",
